  "description": "Piljoo poured his life into supporting Taejoon. Growing up as orphans, all their firsts were together. So when Taejoon announces he’s marrying a woman—in the middle of sex—Piljoo is devastated. Taejoon’s convinced marrying rich will finally bring them safety and stability, but Piljoo breaks in the face of his lover’s betrayal. When he meets rich, sexy Seungpyoo, maybe it’s time Piljoo finally does something for himself. \n\n(Source: Tapas)",
